  "id": "psychophysical-parallelism",
  "term": "psychophysical parallelism",
  "definition": "Psychophysical parallelism is the view that mental states or dispositions consistently correspond with bodily, especially nervous, processes. In this account, enduring possibilities of consciousness are matched by enduring possibilities of nervous activity.",
